 const text=error.name==='SecurityError'?'This browser is blocking local course storage. Your work can remain on screen, but it will not survive closing this page. Print your work before leaving; use a browser that allows local storage for this file.':error.name==='QuotaExceededError'?'Browser storage is full. Your complete draft remains on screen and the last confirmed save is unchanged. Print your work before leaving.':error.message||'Saving failed. Your visible draft and last confirmed save are preserved.';
